### 2. 搜索匹配规则
通过分析页面 JavaScript 源代码（`/src/lib/staticVibeSdk.js`），发现搜索实际上是 **前端客户端搜索**，而非后端 API 搜索。数据为静态内置的 54 名律师数据。

#### 搜索流程：

**第一步：关键词标准化（normalizeSearch 函数）**
```javascript
const normalizeSearch = q => {
  if (!q) return '';
  return String(q).normalize('NFKC')
    .replace(/[《》「」『』""''·\s,.，。、;；:：!！?？()（）]/g, '')
    .toLowerCase().trim();
};
```
- 使用 NFKC Unicode 标准化
- 移除标点符号：《》「」『』""''·空格逗号句号分号冒号感叹号问号括号等
- 转小写
- 去除首尾空白

**第二步：律师数据匹配（searchLawyers 函数）**
```javascript
const searchLawyers = (lawyers, search) => {
  if (!search) return lawyers;
  const normalized = normalizeSearch(search);
  if (!normalized) return lawyers;
  return lawyers.filter(l => {
    const name = normalizeSearch(l.f_name);
    const office = normalizeSearch(l.f_office);
    const tags = normalizeSearch(l.f_tags);
    const city = normalizeSearch(l.f_city);
    return name.includes(normalized) || 
           office.includes(normalized) || 
           tags.includes(normalized) || 
           city.includes(normalized);
  });
};
```

